WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,240
Just these few palaces

2
00:00:01,240 --> 00:00:02,240
Can't you order supplies from the cloud?

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,240
Cloud for you

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,240
What should my family eat?

5
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:11,240
Who knows when the rain will stop?

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,240
Just exchange for something

7
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,010
What you are doing is illegal

8
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,300
You have to die if you get caught, grab it quickly

9
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,300
Too terrible

10
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:34,580
So what should we do next?

11
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:39,940
I hope it rains

12
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,780
Stop it quickly

13
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:54,150
It would be great if it was full

14
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:56,150
Even if it is full, it would be great
